update content_bodies set title = '7 Must-Try Popular Gourmet Foods in Fukushima for Your Trip', description = 'This video serves as a guide for those traveling to Fukushima Prefecture, showcasing seven popular gourmet foods that you must try. If you have any recommendations that are not mentioned in the video, feel free to share them in the comments section. The channel, ''Travel Expert,'' aims to enhance your travel experience by providing various travel information, including sightseeing, transportation, accommodation, and dining. The team behind the channel believes in enriching lives through travel and encourages viewers to explore new possibilities and experiences. For more information and updates, follow their official social media accounts.' where id = '7yBc43_2veiRSv41vexLn';
update content_bodies set title = '道東凍冬，一起凍冬趣（美食篇・飯店篇)', description = 'この記事では、台湾女子の北海道生活を通じて、道東の魅力的な風景やアイヌ文化に触れた体験を紹介しています。特に阿寒湖の美しさや、阿寒鶴雅別荘鄙の座での贅沢な宿泊体験が強調されています。また、養老牛の山本牧場や森のホール、ONUKI COFFEE ROASTERYなど、地域の美食やホスピタリティを体験できる撮影スポットも紹介されています。北海道の自然の美しさを感じることができる貴重な体験が詰まった内容です。' where id = '7qQd-vB-EFF7_8XiZIk98';
update content_bodies set title = 'Frozen Winter in Eastern Hokkaido: A Culinary and Hotel Experience', description = 'This article explores the life of a Taiwanese woman in Hokkaido, Japan, focusing on the enchanting landscapes of Eastern Hokkaido and the cultural significance of Lake Akan to the Ainu people. It highlights unique experiences such as the hidden gems of Hokkaido''s natural beauty and the luxurious accommodations at Akan Tsuruga Besso Hinanoza. The article also features various shooting locations, including Yamamoto Farm in Nakashibetsu, Mori no Hall in Kussharo, and Onuki Coffee Roastery, showcasing the region''s culinary delights and hospitality.' where id = 'vCx1vSyulWnymcKPHuJfE';
update content_bodies set title = 'お気持ちはわかるのですが・・・　＃草津温泉 #大家族フォーサイス家 ＃謝罪動画', description = '草津温泉をご愛顧いただき、誠にありがとうございます。世界中の皆様にお詫びしたいことがあり、それを動画にしました。日常の中で当たり前と思われることが、実はそうではないこともあります。どうか寛容な心で最後までご覧いただき、笑ってご容赦いただければ幸いです。皆様により楽しんでいただける温泉地を目指して邁進して参りますので、今後とも草津温泉をご愛顧いただけますようお願い申し上げます。撮影・編集はCOOTSが担当し、撮影スポットは湯畑、バスターミナル足湯、ロックハート城（高山村）です。キャストは大家族フォーサイス家です。' where id = '0diLUGq5LD8mZL-q0JuMl';
update content_bodies set title = 'We Understand Your Feelings... #KusatsuOnsen #ForsythFamily #ApologyVideo', description = 'We sincerely thank you for your continued support of Kusatsu Onsen. We have a few apologies to make to everyone around the world, which we have put into a video. In our daily lives, what seems obvious is not always so. We hope you can watch until the end with a generous heart and perhaps even smile in understanding. We are committed to making Kusatsu Onsen a more enjoyable destination for everyone. We sincerely hope you will continue to support Kusatsu Onsen in the future. Filming and editing by COOTS. Filming locations include Yubatake, Bus Terminal Ashiyu, and Lockhart Castle (Takayama Village). Cast: The Forsyth Family.' where id = 'kxXApLsSfiWUYL-FJcpo8';
update content_bodies set title = 'ふかまる　あたたまる　大切な記念日　-Anniversary KusatsuOnsen-', description = '恋人と語り合う日、家族と笑い合う日、友人と深め合う日。草津温泉では、毎日が特別な記念日です。そのために、特別な旅行にふさわしいおもてなしを提供し、お客様の大切な1日をこれからもサポートしていきます。' where id = 'hF5wrpSAHB1ifpiSl5vlU';
update content_bodies set title = 'Deepening Bonds on Special Anniversaries - Anniversary KusatsuOnsen', description = 'A day to converse with a loved one, a day to share laughter with family, and a day to strengthen friendships. At Kusatsu Onsen, every day can be a special anniversary for our guests. We are committed to providing exceptional hospitality that is fitting for such a unique trip, ensuring that we continue to celebrate our guests'' important days.' where id = '6URaQ_cL26hQs7HL5FtrD';
