update content_bodies set title = '浜田城跡 〜浜田の歴史にタイムスリップ〜', description = '浜田市街の中心に位置する城山公園の山頂にある浜田城跡は、1620年に築かれ約250年間存在したお城です。現在は石垣のみが残り、公園として日本海や浜田の町並みを一望できるスポットとなっています。動画の後半では、かつての浜田城の北前船貿易港である外ノ浦にある「浜田の夕日自動販売機」も紹介されているので、ぜひご覧ください。' where id = 'OkruwvO7bp2nCJ3YgBMSE';
update content_bodies set title = 'Hamada Castle Ruins - A Time Slip into Hamada''s History', description = 'Located at the top of Mount Jōyama in the center of Hamada City, the Hamada Castle Ruins were established in 1620 and lasted for about 250 years. Today, only the stone walls remain, and the site serves as a park offering a panoramic view of the Japan Sea and the town of Hamada. In the latter part of the video, viewers can also see the ''Hamada Sunset Vending Machine'' located at the northern port of trade, Soto-no-Ura, which was once part of the Hamada Castle''s trade activities. Be sure to check it out!' where id = 'U0BEJ-Y3eQNvq74kEREC-';
